meta {
  name: 01 - Create
  seq: 1
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Both creation paths (mirroring `POST`/`PUT /document` in `docs/API.md`), plus the two
  obvious 400 validation cases. Run "Direct Upload (PUT)" first if you want `{{documentId}}`
  populated for the other folders - its post-response script saves the created id and
  version as collection variables so the rest of the collection can reuse them without
  manual copy-pasting.
}
